# Restored on 29 September 2026. The copy shipped in the deposit zip was narrower than the one
# in the repository and silently dropped four patterns when it overwrote it: node_modules/,
# *.log, ~$* and .ipynb_checkpoints/. ~$* matters most — those are the lock files Word and
# PowerPoint leave beside an open .docx or .pptx, and committing one is how a stray
# ~$Manuscript.docx ends up in a public archive.

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
~$*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# The figure builders write a per-figure deck every time they run, and the published figures go
# to the journal directly rather than into this archive, so no .pptx belongs here at all.
# analysis/check_deposit_integrity.py fails if one is staged.
*.pptx

# Figure outputs the builders regenerate. The published figures go to the journal, so these are
# derivations rather than deposit content, and three of them were removed on 30 September 2026.
# Without these lines a single run of a builder puts them straight back into the working tree,
# where they read as new files to commit.
data/Figure7_FeatureMatrix.svg
data/Figure5D_FeatureMatrix.svg
data/Figure2A_panel.pdf
data/Figure2A_panel.png
